WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.852
This comparison focuses on the preparation problem
Structured data

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:12.709
is already tabular so we can usually begin with
profiling and cleaning Semi-structured

00:00:12.735 --> 00:00:18.334
data may need normalization or flattening
Unstructured data usually

00:00:18.347 --> 00:00:23.860
requires feature extraction or annotation before it
can be analyzed using ordinary tabular methods

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:31.120
Real informatics projects often combine all three
forms so understanding the organization tells

00:00:31.146 --> 00:00:33.146
you what preparation work comes first
